{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_012KBuU4kT7YM7u6Bhu4VYhM", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luis_de_Li%C3%B3n\"}, {\"url\": \"https://semanariouniversidad.com/?p=115903\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.hmdb.org/m.asp?m=105275\"}, {\"url\": \"https://exhibits.lib.unc.edu/exhibits/show/maya/modern/el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba\"}, {\"url\": \"https://es.hispanopedia.com/wiki/Luis_de_Lion\"}, {\"url\": \"https://plumazos.substack.com/p/tres-novelas-guatemaltecas-imprescindibles\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.hmdb.org/m.asp?m=103528\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.nli.org.il/he/authorities/987012292209405171\"}, {\"url\": \"https://lahora.gt/secciones-para-ti/cultura/wpcomvip/2017/05/15/recordando-luis-lion/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.nli.org.il/en/authorities/987012292209405171\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:50:50.545Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "José Luis de León Díaz novela San Pascualito escritor guatemalteco", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01EaqWDxoN4zcL9ydhozCky3", "content": [{"title": "Luis de Li%C3%B3n", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luis_de_Li%C3%B3n"}, {"title": "semanariouniversidad.com", "url": "https://semanariouniversidad.com/?p=115903"}, {"title": "Marker Logo", "url": "https://www.hmdb.org/m.asp?m=105275"}, {"title": "el tiempo principia en xibalba", "url": "https://exhibits.lib.unc.edu/exhibits/show/maya/modern/el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba"}, {"title": "Luis de Lion", "url": "https://es.hispanopedia.com/wiki/Luis_de_Lion"}, {"title": "Tres novelas guatemaltecas imprescindibles", "url": "https://plumazos.substack.com/p/tres-novelas-guatemaltecas-imprescindibles"}, {"title": "Marker Logo", "url": "https://www.hmdb.org/m.asp?m=103528"}, {"title": "Lión, Luis de, 1939-1984", "url": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/authorities/987012292209405171"}, {"title": "Por redacción Cultura", "url": "https://lahora.gt/secciones-para-ti/cultura/wpcomvip/2017/05/15/recordando-luis-lion/"}, {"title": "Lión, Luis de, 1939-1984", "url": "https://www.nli.org.il/en/authorities/987012292209405171"}]}, "I found no mention of a novel called \"San Pascualito\" in these results. The author is Luis de Lión, the pen name of José Luis de León Díaz, and his best-known novel is *El tiempo principia en Xibalbá*. You may be thinking of that book or a different title.\n\n- **Identity:** He was born in San Juan del Obispo, Sacatepéquez, in 1939 and is described as a poet, novelist, and teacher who was one of Guatemala's first indigenous writers in Spanish in the twentieth century.\n- **Disappearance:** Armed men seized him in Guatemala City in May 1984. A 1999 document, the Diario Militar, stated he was extrajudicially executed on June 5 of that year. Other sources give June 6, 1984 as the date of death.\n- **Main novel:** *El tiempo principia en Xibalbá* won the Central American novel prize at the Juegos Florales at Quetzaltenango in 1972. It was not published, however, until 1985, after Lión's death. It follows Pascual Baeza, an indigenous man who deserts the army and lives experiences of marginalization and racism in the city, alongside a second protagonist, Juan Caca."], "durationSeconds": 4.955621166999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_012KBuU4kT7YM7u6Bhu4VYhM", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
