{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01Bdkac9cZiYmkoFHu4Fn5Kg", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Pascualito\"}, {\"url\": \"https://uapress.arizona.edu/book/time-commences-in-xibalba\"}, {\"url\": \"https://parnassusbooks.net/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://rdbooks.org/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://chaucersbooks.com/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://northtownbooks.com/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://biblat.unam.mx/en/revista/liminar-estudios-sociales-y-humanisticos/articulo/el-divino-mestizo-frente-a-la-maquina-de-guerra-mimesis-heterogenea-y-subjetividad-migrante-en-el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba-de-luis-de-lion\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mitpressbookstore.mit.edu/book/9780816521340\"}, {\"url\": \"https://trehlus21.corpeeu.org/node/6210\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ubcpress.ca/time-commences-in-xibalba\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:51:00.959Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Luis de Lión \"San Pascualito\" novela", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_0112neQUvAP8QxFBGLYryRrX", "content": [{"title": "San Pascualito", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Pascualito"}, {"title": "Time Commences in Xibalbá", "url": "https://uapress.arizona.edu/book/time-commences-in-xibalba"}, {"title": "parnassusbooks.net", "url": "https://parnassusbooks.net/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "rdbooks.org", "url": "https://rdbooks.org/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "Time Commences in Xibalbá (Sun Tracks )", "url": "https://chaucersbooks.com/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "northtownbooks.com", "url": "https://northtownbooks.com/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "Journal: | Liminar estudios sociales y humanísticos |", "url": "https://biblat.unam.mx/en/revista/liminar-estudios-sociales-y-humanisticos/articulo/el-divino-mestizo-frente-a-la-maquina-de-guerra-mimesis-heterogenea-y-subjetividad-migrante-en-el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba-de-luis-de-lion"}, {"title": "Time Commences in Xibalbá (Sun Tracks )", "url": "https://mitpressbookstore.mit.edu/book/9780816521340"}, {"title": "trehlus21.corpeeu.org", "url": "https://trehlus21.corpeeu.org/node/6210"}, {"title": "Time Commences in Xibalbá", "url": "https://ubcpress.ca/time-commences-in-xibalba"}]}, "The novel is *El tiempo principia en Xibalbá* (\"Time Commences in Xibalbá\") by Guatemalan author Luis de Lión, and San Pascualito appears in it as a character.\n\n- **San Pascualito in the novel:** The folk saint is represented by a character named Pascal in the book. The saint himself is a folk figure tied to Saint Paschal Baylon and venerated in Guatemala and Chiapas.\n- **Plot:** The book's protagonist is Pascual, a man whose return to his home village sets off a violent local crisis. Reviewers describe him as changed—both scarred and \"enlightened\" by his experiences after serving with the military.\n- **Original edition:** A 1985 Guatemala City edition from Editorial Serviprensa Centroamericana is listed, with 87 pages.\n- **English translation:** The University of Arizona Press published an English version translated by Nathan C. Henne, with an afterword by Arturo Arias, in 2012.\n- **Author:** De Lión was a primary teacher who worked in rural schools in various parts of Guatemala and later taught at the University of San Carlos. In 1984 he was kidnapped by a death squad of the Guatemalan dictatorship, and he is presumed to have been killed three weeks later.\n- **Scholarship:** One academic article in *Liminar* calls it the only novel by the Guatemalan writer Luis de Lión."], "durationSeconds": 6.3062183749999985, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01Bdkac9cZiYmkoFHu4Fn5Kg", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEPNjLjJdsPgCg3W3Zga", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**Respuesta:** *El tiempo principia en Xibalbá* (1985, póstuma). José Luis de León Díaz escribía con el seudónimo Luis de Lión. En esa novela, el protagonista Pascual se relaciona con San Pascualito, el santo popular que se asocia con San Pascual Bailón. Los resultados no son del todo claros en cuanto a que San Pascualito sea el personaje principal. Hablan de un protagonista llamado Pascual y de un personaje \"Pascal\" que representa al santo.\n\nSegún un artículo académico de *Liminar*, es la única novela del autor. Eso encaja con que sea la que buscas.\n\nSources:\n- [Luis de Lión (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luis_de_Li%C3%B3n)\n- [San Pascualito (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Pascualito)\n- [Time Commences in Xibalbá (University of Arizona Press)](https://uapress.arizona.edu/book/time-commences-in-xibalba)\n- [Artículo de Liminar sobre la novela](https://biblat.unam.mx/en/revista/liminar-estudios-sociales-y-humanisticos/articulo/el-divino-mestizo-frente-a-la-maquina-de-guerra-mimesis-heterogenea-y-subjetividad-migrante-en-el-tiempo-principia-en-xibalba-de-luis-de-lion)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1486, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5411, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1486}, "output_tokens": 514, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:51:05.075Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEPNj4rwoBozk8A6LLB5"}
